# Omit VITE_API_URL to use same-origin /api (recommended):
#   Local: Vite proxies /api → http://127.0.0.1:3000 (run `npm run dev:backend` from repo root).
#   Vercel: vercel.json rewrites /api → https://backend.partfinder.store/api/*
#
# Optional absolute API origin (skips Vite proxy):
# VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
